# Profil resource VPS-INFRA — HEMAT (VPS 4GB, untuk uji & pilot kecil).
# Pakai: docker compose --env-file infra.env.4gb up -d --build
# Total limit: gateway 2500m + mosquitto 128m + bridge 192m ≈ 2.8GB, sisa ~1.2GB utk OS+swap.
# DEPRECATED: shared gateway runtime is owned by lumite-gateway. Do not use for production.
# Historical capacity note: ~5-6 WhatsApp sessions on a 4GB profile.
GW_MEM_LIMIT=2500m
GW_SHM=512m
MQTT_MEM_LIMIT=128m
BRIDGE_MEM_LIMIT=192m
